{
 "title": "Is lightning hotter than the Sun",
 "sentences": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "display": "Is lightning hotter than the Sun?",
   "title": true,
   "start": 0.03,
   "end": 1.78,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "display": "Yes. About FIVE times hotter.",
   "start": 2.07,
   "end": 4.32,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "display": "Most people think the Sun is the hottest thing they'll ever see.",
   "start": 4.67,
   "end": 7.8,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "display": "It's not.",
   "start": 8.18,
   "end": 8.86,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "display": "A flash in the sky.",
   "start": 9.18,
   "end": 10.43,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "display": "A crack outside your window.",
   "start": 10.73,
   "end": 12.19,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "display": "A storm rolling over the hills.",
   "start": 12.53,
   "end": 14.51,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "display": "But look at what's actually happening.",
   "start": 14.86,
   "end": 16.7,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "display": "A bolt of lightning slams through the air…",
   "start": 17.08,
   "end": 19.27,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "display": "and in a split second, it heats that tiny channel to about… 30,000 degrees.",
   "start": 19.52,
   "end": 24.32,
   "pauseBefore": null,
   "marks": [
    [
     4,
     20.67,
     20.84
    ],
    [
     11,
     22.68,
     22.84
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "display": "The surface of the Sun… only about five and a half thousand.",
   "start": 24.62,
   "end": 27.72,
   "pauseBefore": null,
   "marks": [
    [
     4,
     25.76,
     26.02
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "display": "That's called PLASMA.",
   "concept": true,
   "start": 28.04,
   "end": 29.47,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "display": "Air so hot, its atoms get ripped apart.",
   "start": 29.76,
   "end": 32.66,
   "pauseBefore": null,
   "marks": [
    [
     2,
     30.79,
     31.03
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "display": "And here's the *crazy* part.",
   "start": 33.03,
   "end": 34.34,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "display": "All that superheated air explodes outward… faster than sound can travel.",
   "start": 34.57,
   "end": 39.19,
   "pauseBefore": null,
   "marks": [
    [
     5,
     37.3,
     37.45
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "display": "That's THUNDER.",
   "start": 39.46,
   "end": 40.48,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "display": "It's not a rumble.",
   "start": 40.72,
   "end": 41.61,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "display": "It's a sonic BOOM… made by lightning.",
   "start": 41.81,
   "end": 44.42,
   "pauseBefore": null,
   "marks": [
    [
     3,
     43.24,
     43.39
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 19,
   "display": "So next time you see a flash, count the seconds until the bang.",
   "start": 44.79,
   "end": 48.2,
   "pauseBefore": null,
   "marks": [
    [
     6,
     46.38,
     46.56
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 20,
   "display": "Every three seconds is about one kilometre away.",
   "start": 48.48,
   "end": 51.18,
   "pauseBefore": null
  },
  {
   "n": 21,
   "display": "And the thing that just lit up your sky… was HOTTER than the Sun.",
   "start": 51.51,
   "end": 54.84,
   "pauseBefore": null,
   "marks": [
